{"path":"contact.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <title>Connect • {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <style>
    :root{--accent:#6b9f67;--accent-2:#f5a623;--muted:#6b7280;--bg:#fbfbfb;--card:#ffffff}
    html,body{height:100%}
    body{margin:0;font-family:Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial;line-height:1.45;color:#0f1724;background:var(--bg);}
    header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:20px 28px;background:transparent;position:relative;z-index:3}
    .brand{display:flex;flex-direction:column}
    .brand h1{margin:0;font-size:18px;letter-spacing:0.4px}
    .brand p{margin:0;font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}
    nav{display:flex;gap:14px}
    nav a{color:#0f1724;text-decoration:none;font-size:14px;padding:8px;border-radius:8px}
    nav a:hover{background:rgba(107,159,103,0.08)}
    main{max-width:1100px;margin:36px auto;padding:28px;position:relative}

    /* Background pattern (inline SVG) */
    .bg-svg{position:fixed;inset:0;pointer-events:none;opacity:0.12}
    .hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 360px;gap:28px;align-items:start}
    .card{background:var(--card);border-radius:14px;padding:20px;box-shadow:0 6px 24px rgba(15,23,36,0.06)}
    .lead{font-size:20px;margin:0 0 8px}
    .sub{color:var(--muted);margin:0 0 18px}
    .cta-row{display:flex;gap:12px}
    .btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px;background:var(--accent);color:white;text-decoration:none;border:none;cursor:pointer}
    .btn.alt{background:transparent;border:1px solid rgba(15,23,36,0.06);color:var(--muted)}

    /* Mood-to-Method */
    .mood{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px}
    .mood .options{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap}
    .mood button{padding:8px 12px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(15,23,36,0.06);background:white;cursor:pointer}
    .mood button.active{background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),var(--accent-2));color:white;border:none}
    .approach{margin-top:8px;padding:12px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(107,159,103,0.06),rgba(245,166,35,0.03));transition:all .42s cubic-bezier(.2,.9,.2,1)}
    .approach h3{margin:0 0 6px}
    .approach p{margin:0;color:var(--muted)}

    /* Pricing comparator */
    .comparator{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px}
    .toggle{display:inline-flex;background:#eef3ea;border-radius:999px;padding:6px}
    .toggle button{border:0;background:transparent;padding:6px 12px;border-radius:999px;cursor:pointer}
    .toggle button.active{background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),var(--accent-2));color:white}
    .pricing-row{display:flex;gap:12px}
    .plan{flex:1;padding:14px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff,#fbfff7);transition:transform .22s;}
    .plan:hover{transform:translateY(-6px)}
    .plan h4{margin:0 0 8px}
    .price{font-weight:700;font-size:24px;color:#0f1724}
    .meta{color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}

    /* Contact form */
    form{display:grid;gap:10px}
    input,textarea{padding:10px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid rgba(15,23,36,0.06);font-size:14px}
    footer{margin-top:18px;color:var(--muted);font-size:14px}

    @media (max-width:880px){.hero{grid-template-columns:1fr}.brand h1{font-size:16px}}

  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <!-- decorative svg pattern -->
  <svg class="bg-svg" width="100%" height="100%" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" preserveAspectRatio="none">
    <defs>
      <pattern id="p1" width="120" height="120" patternUnits="userSpaceOnUse" patternTransform="rotate(20)">
        <rect width="120" height="120" fill="rgba(107,159,103,0.02)" />
        <path d="M0 60 C30 40 90 80 120 60" stroke="rgba(245,166,35,0.06)" stroke-width="2" fill="none" />
        <circle cx="20" cy="20" r="3" fill="rgba(107,159,103,0.06)" />
        <circle cx="100" cy="100" r="2" fill="rgba(245,166,35,0.04)" />
      </pattern>
    </defs>
    <rect width="100%" height="100%" fill="url(#p1)" />
  </svg>

  <header>
    <div class="brand">
      <h1>{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</h1>
      <p>{{TAGLINE}}</p>
    </div>
    <nav aria-label="Main navigation">
      <a href="index.html">Home</a>
      <a href="about.html">Story</a>
      <a href="services.html">Offerings</a>
      <a href="programs.html">Series</a>
      <a href="pricing.html">Rates</a>
      <a href="testimonials.html">Praise</a>
      <a href="book.html">Book</a>
      <a href="contact.html">Connect</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="hero">
      <div>
        <div class="card">
          <h2 class="lead">Reach out — small steps with clear guidance</h2>
          <p class="sub">Share where you are right now and we’ll point to a short pathway: sustainable habits, gentle structure, and measurable shifts.</p>

          <div style="display:flex;gap:12px;margin-bottom:12px;align-items:center">
            <a class="btn" id="primaryCta" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
            <a class="btn alt" href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">Email</a>
          </div>

          <!-- Mood-to-Method widget -->
          <div class="mood" aria-live="polite">
            <strong>How are you feeling today?</strong>
            <div class="options" role="tablist" aria-label="Mood selector">
              <button data-key="stuck" class="mood-btn" role="tab">Stuck</button>
              <button data-key="busy" class="mood-btn">Overloaded</button>
              <button data-key="curious" class="mood-btn">Curious</button>
              <button data-key="reset" class="mood-btn">Need Rest</button>
            </div>

            <div class="approach card" id="approach">
              <h3 id="approachTitle">Pick a mood to see a focused approach</h3>
              <p id="approachDesc">Short, practical guidance will appear here with a suggested next step and a tailored call to action.</p>
              <div style="margin-top:12px">
                <a id="approachCta" class="btn" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

        </div>

        <!-- Pricing comparator micro -->
        <div style="margin-top:16px" class="card">
          <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:8px">
            <div>
              <strong>Rate comparator</strong>
              <div class="meta">Toggle to compare monthly vs series package</div>
            </div>
            <div class="toggle" role="tablist" aria-label="Pricing toggle">
              <button id="toggleMonthly" class="active">Monthly</button>
              <button id="togglePack">Pack</button>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="pricing-row">
            <div class="plan">
              <h4>Momentum Sessions</h4>
              <div class="price">$
                <span class="anim" + " price-num" data-monthly="140" data-pack="750">140</span>
              </div>
              <div class="meta" id="meta1">per session / 30–45 min</div>
            </div>
            <div class="plan">
              <h4>Focus Series (5)</h4>
              <div class="price">$
                <span class="anim price-num" data-monthly="120" data-pack="600">120</span>
              </div>
              <div class="meta" id="meta2">avg per session if booked as pack</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>

      <!-- Right column: contact form -->
      <aside>
        <div class="card">
          <h3 style="margin-top:0">Get in touch</h3>
          <p class="sub">Tell me a few lines — I’ll recommend a clear next step. Prefer to call? {{PHONE}}. Prefer email? {{EMAIL}}.</p>

          <form id="contactForm" action="/" method="post" onsubmit="event.preventDefault();alert('Thanks — we\'ll be in touch.')">
            <input required name="name" placeholder="Your name" />
            <input required name="email" placeholder="Your email" />
            <input name="phone" placeholder="Phone (optional)" />
            <textarea name="note" rows="4" placeholder="A few lines about where you are — habits, obstacles, or goals"></textarea>
            <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:6px">
              <button class="btn" type="submit">Reach Out</button>
              <button type="button" class="btn alt" id="quickCall">Request Call</button>
            </div>
          </form>

          <footer>
            <div style="margin-top:12px">Serving {{CITY}}, {{STATE}} • <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}">{{PHONE}}</a> • <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a></div>
          </footer>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </section>

    <section style="margin-top:20px" class="card">
      <strong>Why reach out here?</strong>
      <p class="sub">You get a custom short plan rooted in practices: habit architecture, energy tuning, and accountability frameworks — no medical advice, only usable steps you can try this week.</p>
    </section>

  </main>

  <script>
    // Mood-to-Method logic
    (function(){
      const actions = {
        stuck:{title:"Short reset kit: 3 micro-habits",desc:"We start with two 10-minute rituals + one accountability habit to break a cycle. Outcome: clearer decisions and small wins.",cta:"Try a Reset Call"},
        busy:{title:"Contain the overwhelm",desc:"We map weekly anchors and a single priority rule. Outcome: fewer choices, calmer days.",cta:"Schedule a Brief Plan"},
        curious:{title:"Experiment & track",desc:"We design a two-week experiment: one habit, simple tracking, one reflection prompt. Outcome: quick feedback and refinement.",cta:"Begin an Experiment"},
        reset:{title:"Slow reset protocol",desc:"We blend rest windows, gentle movement, and an evening unwind. Outcome: steadier energy across the week.",cta:"Book a Rest Review"}
      };

      const opts = document.querySelectorAll('.mood .options .mood-btn');
      const titleEl = document.getElementById('approachTitle');
      const descEl = document.getElementById('approachDesc');
      const ctaEl = document.getElementById('approachCta');
      const primaryCta = document.getElementById('primaryCta');

      function setMood(key,btn){
        // update visual
        opts.forEach(b=>b.classList.remove('active'));
        if(btn) btn.classList.add('active');
        const a = actions[key];
        // small morph animation
        titleEl.style.opacity = 0; descEl.style.opacity = 0; ctaEl.style.opacity = 0;
        setTimeout(()=>{
          titleEl.textContent = a.title;
          descEl.textContent = a.desc;
          ctaEl.textContent = a.cta;

          // Update CTA href with mood param
          const base = '{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}';
          ctaEl.href = base + (base.includes('?') ? '&' : '?') + 'mood=' + encodeURIComponent(key);
          primaryCta.href = base + (base.includes('?') ? '&' : '?') + 'mood=' + encodeURIComponent(key);

          titleEl.style.opacity = 1; descEl.style.opacity = 1; ctaEl.style.opacity = 1;
        },240);
      }

      opts.forEach(b=>{
        b.addEventListener('click',()=>setMood(b.dataset.key,b));
      });

      // default highlight
      // choose one by seed to vary slightly per build (use a simple hash)
      const keys = Object.keys(actions);
      const seed = %d; // placeholder-replaced by engine seed at runtime? keep as literal number
      const pick = keys[seed % keys.length];
      const startBtn = Array.from(opts).find(x=>x.dataset.key===pick) || opts[0];
      setTimeout(()=>setMood(startBtn.dataset.key,startBtn),60);
    })();

    // Pricing comparator with animated numbers
    (function(){
      const monthlyBtn = document.getElementById('toggleMonthly');
      const packBtn = document.getElementById('togglePack');
      const nums = document.querySelectorAll('.price-num');
      let mode = 'monthly';

      function animateTo(el,from,to,duration){
        const start = performance.now();
        from = Number(from); to = Number(to);
        function frame(now){
          const t = Math.min(1,(now-start)/duration);
          const eased = t<.5 ? 2*t*t : -1+ (4-2*t)*t; // simple ease
          const val = Math.round(from + (to-from)*eased);
          el.textContent = val;
          if(t<1) requestAnimationFrame(frame);
        }
        requestAnimationFrame(frame);
      }

      function setMode(m){
        mode = m;
        if(m==='monthly'){ monthlyBtn.classList.add('active'); packBtn.classList.remove('active'); }
        else { packBtn.classList.add('active'); monthlyBtn.classList.remove('active'); }
        nums.forEach(n=>{
          const current = Number(n.textContent);
          const target = Number(n.dataset[m==='monthly' ? 'monthly' : 'pack']);
          animateTo(n,current,target,520);
        });
      }

      monthlyBtn.addEventListener('click',()=>setMode('monthly'));
      packBtn.addEventListener('click',()=>setMode('pack'));

      // init: ensure values show monthly or pack depending on stored preference
      setMode('monthly');
    })();

    // Quick call button: populate phone compose
    document.getElementById('quickCall').addEventListener('click',function(){
      window.location.href = 'tel:' + '{{PHONE}}';
    });
  </script>
</body>
</html>"} 
{"path":"README.md","content":"This bundle contains the contact page and usage notes for the wellness coach site.

Files:
- contact.html: The interactive contact page with two key micro-features: a Pricing Comparator and a Mood-to-Method selector.

How to use:
1. Open contact.html in a browser (no server required).
2. Mood-to-Method selector: click any mood button (Stuck, Overloaded, Curious, Need Rest). The recommended approach title, description, and the CTA will morph with a short animation and the CTA links will receive a mood query parameter.
3. Pricing Comparator: toggle between "Monthly" and "Pack". Prices animate to new values using a smooth easing function.
4. Contact form: the form is client-side only and prevents submission; replace with your form endpoint as needed. The "Request Call" button will attempt to call the phone number placeholder.

Placeholders to replace in the template:
- {{BUSINESS_NAME}}
- {{TAGLINE}}
- {{PHONE}}
- {{EMAIL}}
- {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}
- {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}
- {{CITY}}
- {{STATE}}

Notes:
- The decorative pattern is embedded as inline SVG in contact.html; no external assets are required.
- All interactive behavior is implemented in local JavaScript within contact.html.
- This page intentionally frames outcomes, habits, and frameworks without making medical claims.

If you integrate this into a larger site, ensure links in the nav match your final structure (index.html, about.html, services.html, programs.html, pricing.html, testimonials.html, book.html, contact.html)."} 
BUNDLE_END
